MIT License

This project is a Python port of the core architecture and scraper logic of
eshaham/israeli-bank-scrapers (https://github.com/eshaham/israeli-bank-scrapers),
originally created by Elad Shaham and contributors, licensed under the MIT
License. Large portions of this port's logic (URLs, selectors, transaction
parsing, login flows) are translated directly from that project's
TypeScript source.

A general field-filling improvement in
israeli_bank_scrapers/helpers/elements_interactions.py (retrying with a
realistic per-keystroke typing delay for Angular reactive forms that
reject fast/uniform synthetic typing) was informed in part by
MotionPeak/israeli-pension-scrapers
(https://github.com/MotionPeak/israeli-pension-scrapers), copyright (c)
2026 Shahar Solomons, also licensed under the MIT License.

